    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 36-layer Ta2O5/SiO2 dielectric filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence at 0 degrees, unpolarized light. Layer sequence: Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2, Ta2O5, SiO2 (36 layers total, alternating starting with Ta2O5). All layer thicknesses bounded between 20 nm and 350 nm. Use Differential Evolution optimizer with population size 20. Initialize 50% of population (10 candidates) with all layers at 100.0 nm uniform thickness. Initialize remaining 50% (10 candidates) with alternating quartet pattern: layers 1-4 at [50, 150, 50, 150] nm repeating for all 36 layers. Spectral simulation range 300-1200 nm with 1 nm resolution. Target bands: maximize transmittance in 420-700 nm band, minimize transmittance in 355-365 nm band, minimize transmittance in 1030-1080 nm band, minimize transmittance at 355 nm single wavelength. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates count, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all valid candidates. Canonical user controls: incidence angles 0 degrees. polarization unpolarized. wavelength intervals 355-355 nm, 355-365 nm, 420-700 nm, 1030-1080 nm. soft objectives: high average transmittance in 420-700 nm; low average transmittance at 355 nm; low average transmittance in 355-365 nm; low average transmittance in 1030-1080 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high transmittance at 355 nm; high transmittance in 355-365 nm; high transmittance in 1030-1080 nm; high loss in 420-700 nm. manufacturing constraints: maximum 36 layers; layer thickness range 20-350 nm.",
